    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that {@link PaxChronology#dateEpochDay(long)} reconstructs the expected {@link PaxDate} from the epoch-day of its equivalent ISO {@link LocalDate}. <p> Each sample pairs a Pax date with the ISO date that falls on the same epoch day. Converting the ISO date to an epoch day and feeding it to the Pax chronology must yield the paired Pax date. Per the Pax calendar, {@code 0001-01-01 (Pax)} corresponds to {@code 0000-12-31 (ISO)}."
   },
